              "name": "Sherry"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used this recipe as I lost mine. I deleted the ginger, and used 3 cups of sugar for a double recipe. I also deleted the pickle crisp as I like these pickles a little soft. Some times that stuff makes the pickles rubbery. I will use this recipe again with the adjustments."
